<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">1 KORIN</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Corinthians</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 KORIN</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Ko</para>
  <para style="mt">KORIN HAE</para>
  <para style="mt2">KALAN PAUL CCAKY KYKHEITNAW</para>
  <para style="mt2">1 Corinthians</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Korin hae kalan Paul Ccaky Kykheitnaw</char> hynh Korin khua kya Khriccaawbuu a raepaw lungkhu zynnaw te Khriccaaw hiinnaw kya byalungnaw a um keiccuze zeipaw nynh thua. Tuh ccyh lyaze Korin khua tuh Grik ram lungkhu khuapi thua zah, Rom nynh ukpaw Akhaia pee khuapi nynh thua. Kungku nawlan, phunglang, hiinzia hoy lei nawlan te beiknaw lante a minthaanpaw khua nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paul nynh a zeinuathe rypaw tuh khriccaawbuu lungkhu kya phiakunaw te seinaw, nopi pise seinaw te zudykunaw kong byakhianaw, silawkunawpaw saw ae leipaw te aepaw kong, khriccaawbuu cciakhaekunaw, Thyaa Muisaw lasung te thoothuinaw kong nynh athua hae. Paul nynh myarya khu lan tua zah hynhcihaw bya alungnaw kya hynh Thehoypaw nynh pawte a ho cipaw kha a langsahpya hae.</para>
  <para style="ip">Byaria 13 nynh a langsahkupaw tuh Pachia nynh a ccungccaw hae kya a pyapaw lakuze abyapi huapaw sungsakunaw hynh hynh-e ccauh lungkhu kya tuh ccungccaw patae nynh a ny hae paw athua cih.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alungkhu Umpaw</para>
  <para style="io1">Byalaanmaw — 1.1-9</para>
  <para style="io1">Khriccaawbuu lungkhu phiakunaw — 1.10—4.21</para>
  <para style="io1">Nopi pise seinaw te innbyn hiinzia — 5.1—7.40</para>
  <para style="io1">Khriccaaw hae te lawki hae — 8.1—11.1</para>
  <para style="io1">Khriccaaw hiinzia te beikzia — 11.2—14.40</para>
  <para style="io1">Khri thoothuinaw te Khri zyntu hae — 15.1-58</para>
  <para style="io1">Judea ram e Khriccaaw hae hanlan lungsing — 16.1-4</para>
  <para style="io1">Lu raveih byatawnaw te athangnaw — 16.5-24</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Beihlangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pachia rynaw liate Jesu Khri locceihtu lang ko athuapaw kae, Paul te kae unopaw Sosthenes nynh,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khri Jesu kya thyaasah thua hae zah mithyaa hae cite ko athua hae paw, Korin khua kya umpaw Pachia khriccaawbuu kalan, minmin te aening Bawipaw athuapaw ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri min a ko hae paw hmin takyh kya a um hae paw balyn kalan ccaw kae ky oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:1">Loc 18.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ah Paaw Pachia te Bawipaw Jesu Khri kyate thawccinaw te daenaw tuh nae tungvaw la um vae sah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jesu Khri liate nanning pya athuapaw Pachia thawccinaw keiccuze nanning hanlan ka Pachia kha zungzae ka luung. <verse number="5-6" style="v" />Khri kong ccaekia tuh nae kya tynsah athua thyhawte, nanning tuh amaw liate pawpaw kya balyn, ho khonaw kya balyn, nynaw kya balyn hoirumsah na thua oh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri yn langku lanpaw na ngaehoi lya oh khe, muisaw lasung na shung oh paw ccangkheit san um khyh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri nin kya nanning tuh ccaenaw na hoi khyh nawlan oh aning nynh athangnaw cia ae tynsah cih oh. <verse number="9" style="v" />A Ccapaw, ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri kya-e vaeccawkunaw kalan nanning ae ko oh paw Pachia tuh a lungzipaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Khriccaawbuu kya Phiakunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Uteno hae, nae kya phiakunaw um leite nanning balyn nynh lunglokunaw na hoi oh zah, alokuhpaw tuanaw te alokuhpaw eenaw kya lungngingnaw na hoi nawlan oh, ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri min te kae ngia oh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Pawccecize, ka uno hae, nae laku kya eikunaw a um cite Khalawi innbyn hae nynh nae konglang kha phe yn thaesah vae hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka ho rypaw tuh, nanning lu raveih nynh, “Kae tuh Paul zuitu nynh ka thua,” “Kae tuh Apollos zuitu nynh ka thua,” “Kae tuh Sefas zuitu nynh ka thua,” “Kae tuh Khri zuitu nynh ka thua,” cite na ho oh paw hynh nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:24">Loc 18.24</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khri tuh phia athua vae tou? Paul tuh nae hanlan vaelantung kya khiade athua tou? Tuhkhyhze Paul min te baptisma na in oh tou? <verse number="14" style="v" />Nanning laku kya Krispas te Kaias laelan hum sanmah baptisma kae la pya khyh oh keiccuze Pachia kha ka luung.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:8">Loc 18.8</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 19:29">19.29</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:23">Rom 16.23</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nanning tuh Paul min te baptisma na in oh cite hum nynh sanmah ho kho vae khyh. <verse number="16" style="v" />(Stefanas innbyn hae kha mah baptisma ka pya hae; tuhlaepaw hum sanmah baptisma ka pyapaw ka nyh khyh.)<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:15">1Ko 16.15</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Pawccecize Khri nynh kae hynh baptisma pya khylan yn saw khyh, thehoypaw ho khylan nynh yn saw. Tuhzemah Khri a vaelantung tuh a thungnaw azo khyh nawlan, hawnaw bya te yn hosah khyh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Khri tuh Pachia Thungnaw te Hawnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pawccecize vaelantung kong phunghopaw hynh ronaw kya a um hae paw hanlan ngaeenaw bya nynh thua, thuasalama khum athua hae paw aening hanlan tuh Pachia thungnaw nynh thua. <verse number="19" style="v" />Pawccecize Ccathyaa kyaze,</para>
  <para style="q1">“A haw hae paw hawnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka roh cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a nyhthya hae paw kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">nythyanaw tuh accakaepaw lang</para>
  <para style="q1">ka tangsah cih,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite azeikuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:14">Isa 29.14</ref> (LXX)</char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" />A hawpaw tuh pawkyamou a um? Kawbya sazae tuh pawkyamou a um? Hynh-e she kyaze byaeiku a thyapaw tuh pawkyamou a um? Pachia nynh laephi hawnaw kha ngaeenaw lang rae khyh tou?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:17">Job 12.17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 19:12">Isa 19.12</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 33:18">33.18</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 44:25">44.25</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v" />Pawccecize laephi ccungccaw hae nynh mih hawnaw liate Pachia a ny khyh hae paw kha Pachia nynh a hawnaw te a raepaw nynh thua, tukeiccuze kaening nynh kae hopaw ngaeenaw bya liate a zynpaw ccungccaw hae tuh khumnaw a mue nawlan hae Pachia nynh a paccyn. <verse number="22" style="v" />Pawccecize Judah hae nynh muihsahnaw hae kha a ngia hae, Grik hae nynh hawnaw kha a ccung hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Thuasalama kaening nynh tuh vaelantung kya a khiade hae paw Khri kong kha nynh kae ho, tuh-e tuh Judah hae hanlan thykunaw thua zah Zenta hae hanlan ngaeenaw nynh thua. <verse number="24" style="v" />Thuasalama ko hae paw Judah hae te Grik hae parouh hanlan Khri tuh Pachia thungnaw te Pachia hawnaw nynh thua. <verse number="25" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia kya-e ngaeenaw tuh ccungccaw hae hawnaw laeze a hawhua, Pachia kya-e nyaanaw tuh ccungccaw hae thawsaenaw laeze a thawsaehua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Uteno hae, nanning konawpaw konglang hynh tuaku tua oh; pynsaw lante a hawpaw patae, a thungpaw patae te sawtua hae paw patae tuh ko thuabua khyh hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Thuasalama Pachia nynh a haw hae paw maethyasah khylan laephi kyaze a ngaee hae paw kha a po hae, te Pachia nynh athungpaw maethyasah khylan laephi kyaze a nyaa hae paw kha a po hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Abyapipaw ccungccaw hae kha accakaepaw lang tangsah khylan, laephi kyaze a nyaa hae paw, a dothatheih hae paw te pawlang a ria lei hae paw kha Pachia nynh a po hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuhteze nynh hum nynh sanmah Pachia malang pookuh kho lan khyh. <verse number="30" style="v" />Khri Jesu kya atynpaw nae hiinnaw a thotakawnaw tuh Pachia nynh thua. Khri tuh aening hanlan hawnaw, dingnaw, thyaapapingnaw te shawkhawnaw lang Pachia nynh a rae vae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Ccathyaa kyaze, “A pookuhpaw ccungccaw tuh Bawipaw kyakhe pookuh sah,” cite azeiku hawte nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:24">Jer 9.24</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Khri Khiadenaw Kong Phunghonaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Uteno hae, nae kalan kae thua lyaze Pachia byakhupaw kha myarya byahothyanaw te hawnaw khate kae hopah khyh oh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Pawccecize Jesu Khri te vaelantung kya a khiadenaw hae kong laelan, nanning kya pawsang mah ny lei lante bya ka paeku vae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Nae kalan kae thua lya kha nyaanaw, rinaw te thyngkunaw te nynh kae thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:9">Loc 18.9</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Bya ka hopaw te phung ka hopaw kha ccungccaw hawnaw te asekuhpaw soihnawpaw bya thua leite, Muisaw te thungnaw langsakunaw nynh thua; <verse number="5" style="v" />tuhteze nynh nae zynnaw tuh ccungccaw hawnaw kya tyn leite, Pachia thungnaw kya atyn cih.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pachia Hawnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuhzemah piccan athua vae hae paw kya tuh hawnaw bya kha kae ho; thuasalama hynh-e she e hawnaw kha thua khyh, a zo cih hae paw hynh-e she e uktu hae hawnaw kha mah thua khyh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuasalama Pachia hawnaw byakhupaw kha nynh kae ho, tuh-e tuh laephi a um mawze Pachia nynh aening phu-enaw hanlan a paccyn ty vae paw thuruh athuapaw hawnaw kha nynh thua. <verse number="8" style="v" />Hynh-e she e uktu hae hum nynh sanmah tuh-e hawnaw tuh nyh khyh hae; a la ny hae ze, a phu-epaw Bawipaw kha vaelantung kya a khiade cih lei hae paw. <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuasalama Ccathyaa kyaze,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Pachia nynh amaw a sungsah</para>
  <para style="q2">hae paw hanlan a paccynpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">uccaw hae kha mit nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">muih boi khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">nakaring nynh thae boi khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw thinlung nynh mah</para>
  <para style="q1">tua boi khyh,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite azeiku hawte nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 64:4">Isa 64.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuasalama Pachia nynh tuh-e hae tuh Muisaw liate aening kalan phe oun phypya vae, pawccecize Muisaw nynh tuh pawpaw balyn kha marya a zah, Pachia kya-e akhupaw uccaw kha heize phe a zah. <verse number="11" style="v" />Pawccecize ccungccaw uccaw hae kha ccungccaw lungkhu umpaw ccungccaw muisaw laelan hum nynh mou a nyh? Tuhawte Pachia uccaw hae kha Pachia Muisaw laelan hum nynh san nyh khyh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Atu aening nynh laephi muisaw kha ah mue khyh oh, Pachia nynh aening oun pyapaw lasung hae kha ah thaethya nawlan oh, Pachia kyate yn thuapaw Muisaw kha nynh ah mue oh. <verse number="13" style="v" />E uccaw hae konglang hynh ccungccaw hawnaw nynh ccangpyapaw bya te kae ho khyh, Thyaa Muisaw nynh ccangpyapaw bya te kae ho zah, Muisaw a hoipaw ccungccaw hae kyakhe muisaw te asekuhpaw byaccing hae kha nynh kae ccaesahpya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Muisaw a hoi leipaw ccungccaw nynh tuh Pachia Muisaw kya-e lasung hae kha mue khyh, pawccecize tuh-e lasung hae tuh aning hanlan ngaeenaw nynh thua. Tuh-e lasung hae tuh muisaw lante kyalya nythya athua keiccuze aning nynh nyh kho khyh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Muisaw a hoipaw ccungccaw nynh tuh pawpaw balyn kha pong a nythya, tuhzemah hum nynh sanmah amaw kha akaw-aleih byakhia kho khyh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Ccathyaa nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Bawipaw kha thuihei kho nawlan,</para>
  <para style="q2">Bawipaw thinlung kha</para>
  <para style="q1">hummou a nyh?” a ci.</para>
  <para style="m">Thuasalama aening tuh Khri thinlung kha ah hoi oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:13">Isa 40.13</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Korin Khriccaawbuu kya Phiakunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Uteno hae, nanning kha muisaw ccungccaw hae hawte kae hopah kho khyh oh, pynsaw ccungccaw hae hawte, Khri kya nosi hae hawte nynh kae hopya oh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Nanning kha samatei te nynh kae kua oh, looh tangpaw kha kae dang khyh oh; pawccecize looh tangpaw kha na ae kho loh khyh oh. Atu cia na ae kho loh khyh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 5:12-13">Heb 5.12-13</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize nanning tuh pynsaw ccungccaw hae nynh na thua ung oh. Pawccecize nanning laku eiungkunaw, pekunaw te phiakunaw phang a um lungkhu tuh pynsaw ccungccaw hae na thua khyh oh tou? Huatawpaw ccungccaw hae hawte na um khyh oh tou? <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawccecize lu kheit nynh, “Kae tuh Paul zuitu nynh ka thua,” ci zah mingccangpaw nynh, “Kae tuh Apollos zuitu nynh ka thua,” a ci; tuhte na ci oh paw tuh pynsaw ccungccaw hae na thua khyh oh tou?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:12">1Ko 1.12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Paul tuh hummou athua? Apollos tuh hummou athua? Bawipaw nynh ccungccaw miakaw kha a pya thyhte, kaening tuh zynnaw kalan ae thuakhae oh paw Pachia ryalahtu hae nynh kae thua. <verse number="6" style="v" />Kae nynh ka lin, Apollos nynh tui bu, thuasalama a lesahthungtu tuh Pachia nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:4-11">Loc 18.4-11</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 18:24-28">24-28</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze a lintupaw hynh pawsang thua khyh, tuibupaw mah pawsang thua khyh, a lesahthungtupaw Pachia rou nynh abyapi athua. <verse number="8" style="v" />Atu a lintupaw te tuibupaw tuh pynkheihpaw nynh thua, milu raveih nynh amaw a ryalawnaw thyhte a ryalaw mee kha a mue cih. <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawccecize kaening tuh Pachia rya a lahkheihtu hae nynh kae thua, nanning tuh Pachia loo, Pachia inn nynh na thua oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pachia nynh yn pyapaw a thawccinaw thyhte, inn myarya sakthyapaw hawte kae nynh aleihpaw kha ka bing zah mingccangpaw nynh tuh-e vawlan khe a sak. Inn saktupaw miakaw nynh tuh-e vawlan pawtemou sak lan cipaw kha raeringkuh sah. <verse number="11" style="v" />Pawccecize Jesu Khri athuapaw phe bingkuh vae paw aleihpaw laelan ccangpaw aleihpaw kha hum nynh sanmah bing kho vae khyh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Atu lukhakheit nynh tuh-e aleihpaw vawlan khe sui te, phua te, aphutepaw lung hae te, thing te, lonua ku te, ccatanphue te a sak lanze— <verse number="13" style="v" />inn saktu milu raveih ryalaw tuh ccaerarih lan alangkuh cih; pawccecize Nin nynh tuh-e tuh pong a langsakuh cih. Pawccecize tuh-e tuh maee te langsaku athua cih, milu raveih ryalaw kha pawcihawpaw ryalaw nynh thua cipaw maee nynh a syntawtua cih. <verse number="14" style="v" />Lukhakheit nynh tuh-e aleihpaw vawlan a sakpaw a ryalaw tuh atyn lanze, aning tuh ryalaw mee a mue cih. <verse number="15" style="v" />Lukhakheit ryalaw kha maee nynh phe a u lanze, aning tuh a shung cih; thuasalama maee kyate lue hawte amaw tuh khum athua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nanning tuh Pachia beikinn na thua oh paw te Pachia Muisaw nae kya a umpaw kha na nyh khyh oh tou?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:19">1Ko 6.19</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:16">2Ko 6.16</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Lukhakheit nynh Pachia beikinn kha a ro lanze, Pachia nynh amaw kha a roh cih. Pawccecize Pachia beikinn tuh athyaa; nanning tuh tuh-e beikinn nynh na thua oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nanning nynh naemaw toulou kha lingkuh nan oh. Hynh-e she kya ka haw cite na tuaku oh ze, a hawpaw lang na tang nawlan oh, a ngaeepaw lang tangty oh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Pawccecize hynh-e laephi hawnaw tuh Pachia malang ngaeenaw nynh thua. Pawccecize Ccathyaa kyaze,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Pachia nynh mihaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">mimaw thyaruhnaw khate</para>
  <para style="q1">a kyng hae,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite azeikuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:13">Job 5.13</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" />Tukoute Ccathyaa kyaze,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Mihaw hae tuanaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">accakaepaw nynh thua cipaw</para>
  <para style="q1">Bawipaw nynh a ny,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite bua azeikuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 94:11">Sam 94.11</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v" />Tukeiccuze hum nynh sanmah ccungccaw hae kong kya pookuh nan sah. Pawccecize pawpaw balyn tuh naemaw kya-e nynh thua. <verse number="22" style="v" />Paul thuasah, Apollos thuasah, Sefas thuasah, laephi thuasah, hiinnaw thuasah, chinaw thuasah, atu she thuasah, malang she thuasah abalyn mawte naemaw kya-e nynh thua. <verse number="23" style="v" />Nanning tuh Khri kya-e nynh na thua oh; Khri tuh Pachia kya-e nynh thua.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Locceihtu hae Ryalawnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae nynh kaening hynh Khri rya a lawpatu hae te Pachia byakhupaw hae kha a synriatu hae lante oun tua hae sah. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuhpiaze synriatu tuh zyn lan umpaw athua cih. <verse number="3" style="v" />Thuasalama nanning nynh thuasah, ccungccaw hae kya-e byapianaw zung nynh thuasah bya nae pia lan oh paw hynh ka hanlan myarya adihpaw uccaw nynh thua. Kamaw te kamaw heize bya ka piakuh khyh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawccecize kamaw te kamaw ka thawthaekupaw pawsang um khyh, thuasalama kae tuh tuh-e liate ka daanglae khyh; ka tungvaw bya yn piatupaw tuh Bawipaw nynh thua. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukeiccuze atu lya mohnaw kya thuruhpaw uccaw hae kha awnaw kalan a thuakhae cih paw te thinlung kya-e paccynkunaw hae a langsakuh cih paw Bawipaw yn thua mawlaezung, accyh azaw maw tuh pawsang byapia nan oh. Ccungccaw miakaw nynh Pachia kyate thehoysahnaw kha a ccou cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Uteno hae, nanning hoynaw elang hynh-e balyn hynh kamaw te Apollos kha tousenaw lang mangte kae hopya oh. Tuh-e tuh nanning nynh Ccathyaa kya azeikuhpaw kha alawe lante na cyi khyh nawlan oh, kaening lu ning kong kyate na ccangku nawlan oh te nanning humhung nynh mah ccungccaw lu kheit kha thehoysahhua te ccangpaw lu kheit kha na rawse khyh nawlan oh nynh thua. <verse number="7" style="v" />Pawccecize na tungvaw kya alaenaw hankhakheit kha hum nynh mou a muih? Mue leite namaw hoi lan na hoipaw pawmou a um? Na mue lan thua ze, tuh-e tuh lasung athua leipaw o-ang lante pawccemou na pooku?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na ry oh paw balyn kha na mue vae oh! Na hoirum vae oh! Kaening umbua leite siapharan lang na tang vae oh! Kaening mah nanning ryte siapharan lang kae tangbua nawlan, siapharan lang la tang ccaccing oh lah ci ka ry. <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia nynh kaening locceihtu hae hynh ming hae nulang nyathyakou kya oun nung zah chia lan seibe hae paw ccungccaw hae hawte oun langsaku cite nynh ka tua, pawccecize kaening tuh laephi hanlan, vaaw hae hanlan te ccungccaw hae hanlan nuinthua lan umpaw dopaw nynh kae thua. <verse number="10" style="v" />Kaening tuh Khri keiccuze mingaee hae nynh kae thua, thuasalama nanning tuh Khri kya mihaw hae nynh na thua oh. Kaening tuh minyaa hae nynh kae thua, thuasalama nanning tuh nae thawsae. Nanning tuh sawtua lan umpaw nynh na thua oh, thuasalama kaening tuh dothatheihpaw nynh kae thua. <verse number="11" style="v" />Atu ccyh cia kaening tuh kae vuelaw, kae tuihaw, kae boeining apue, oun zia oun bua hae zah inn leite nynh kae um. <verse number="12" style="v" />Kae kuih te thawte rya kae lawkuh. Thya oun law hae ze hythua kae pya hae; vawsawnaw oun pya hae ze phang kae ngaesang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:3">Loc 18.3</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Thethya oun ho hae ze byanepaw te kae beih hae. Kaening tuh atunin cia laephi kya-e athu-anangpaw hawte kae thua zah pawpaw balyn kya-e athupaw hae hawte mah kae thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Paaw hawte Paul nynh Do-oihnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hynh-e hae hynh nanning maethyasah khylan ka zei khyh, thuasalama ka sungsahpaw ka ccaaw hae hawte raeringkunaw nynh kae pya oh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Pawccecize Khri kya ccangpahtu hae thong haw na hoi oh zemah paaw hae patae na hoi khyh oh; pawccecize thehoypaw liate Khri Jesu kya kae tuh nae paaw lang ka tang vae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tukeiccuze kae hynh oun dosuinkuh oh cite kae ngia oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:1">1Ko 11.1</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:17">Fil 3.17</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Hynh-e keiccuze Bawipaw kya a lungzipaw, ka sungsahpaw ka ccapaw Timote kha nae kalan kae saw. Hmin takyh kya umpaw khriccaawbuu miakaw kya ka ccangpya hae hawte, Khri Jesu kya ka hiinzia kha aning nynh ae la liathuisah cih oh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Ccungccaw abang nynh kae tuh nae kalan kae thua tali vae lan khyh cite tua hae zah a tansaku hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Thuasalama Bawipaw nynh a ry ze, nae kalan taloi kae thua cih. A tansakuh hae paw bya kha do leite mih thungnaw kha nynh ka do cih. <verse number="20" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia peenaw tuh bya kya um khyh, thungnaw kya nynh a um. <verse number="21" style="v" />Pawmou na ry oh? Tungbang tetou nae kalan kae thua cih? Tuhkhyhze sungsakunaw te, nebaleihpaw thinlung tetou kae thua cih?</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ohhuakunaw nynh Khriccaawbuu Thusah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nanning laku ohhuakunaw a um cite ka thae, tuhcihawpaw ohhuakunaw tuh lawki hae kya heize thae boi lan um khyh; ccungccaw lu kheit nynh a paaw zu kha palei a ikhae cite ka thae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 22:30">Deu 22.30</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Nanning tuh na tansakuh oh! Khate a cyihpaw ccungccaw kha nae kyate ccaring dee athua nawlan nanning tuh rawkhui lan ccan khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize kae tuh pynsaw lante nanning ryte ka um khyh zemah muisaw lante ka um; nae kya ka um buapaw hawte tuhcihawpaw a cyihpaw ccungccaw kha ah Bawipaw Jesu min te bya phe ka pia vae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Na pumku vae oh ze, ah Bawipaw Jesu thungnaw liate ka muisaw tuh nae kya umbua zah, <verse number="5" style="v" />tuh-e paw a muisaw tuh Bawipaw Jesu Nin kya khum a thua nawlan, a pynsaw kha ro khylan amaw tuh Satan kalan na ap cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nanning na pooku oh paw tuh hoy khyh. Ccapyhtaripaw ransi nynh vaepoi khaleih kha a thosah cipaw na nyh khyh oh tou?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:9">Gal 5.9</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Nanning tuh ransi phing leipaw na thua oh hawte, athawpaw vaepoi na thua nawlan oh, arynpaw ransi kha marya cciccae oh. Pawccecize aening Kawtaw Poi tuutaw athuapaw Khri tuh aening hanlan silawnawpaw lang chia athua vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:5">Exo 12.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze arynpaw ransi, thyaruhnaw te hoyleinaw ransi khate thua leite, ransi phing leipaw sanlou athuapaw thinlung athyaapaw te byaccing khate poi kha tua oh sih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:7">Exo 13.7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:3">Deu 16.3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Ohhuakunaw kha Byapia Thua Cih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A ohhuakuh hae paw ryte na mungku khyh nawlan oh, ka ccaky kya nae kalan phe kae zei vae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuhzemah hynh-e laephi kya-e a ohhuakuh hae paw, a karankuh hae paw, ccungccaw a luade hae paw te zohtuh beik hae paw ryte kharouh mungkuh nan oh cite ka ho rypaw thua khyh; tuhte ka ho lanze nanning tuh laephi kyate na pou oh aho vae cih. <verse number="11" style="v" />Thuasalama uno cite ko athua pite a ohhuakuhpaw, a karankuhpaw, zohtuh beikpaw, ccungccaw thethya hopaw, aruipaw, ccungccaw a luadepaw ryte mungkuh nan oh, ae mah aekheih nan oh cite atu nae kalan ccaw kae zei. <verse number="12" style="v" />Atolang e ccungccaw hae kha byapia lanpaw tuh kae nynh pawmou ka se? Alungkhu e ccungccaw hae kha nanning nynh byapia lanpaw thua khyh tou? <verse number="13" style="v" />Atolang e ccungccaw hae kha Pachia nynh bya a pia cih hae. Ccathyaa nynh, “Ccungccaw hoyleipaw kha nae kyate ccaring dee oh,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 13:5">Deu 13.5</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 17:7">17.7</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Uno kha Kaethe Nan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nanning lu kheit te lu kheit byathan na hoi vae oh ze mithyaa hae malang thuakhaeku leite ading lei hae paw malang byapiazung lang na thuakhae ngan oh tou? <verse number="2" style="v" />Laephi hynh mithyaa hae nynh byapia cih hae cipaw na nyh khyh oh tou? Nanning nynh laephi hynh bya na pia lan oh athua ze, adih huapaw byathan hae kha bya na pia kho khyh oh tou? <verse number="3" style="v" />Vaawccungccaw hae kha aening nynh byapia lan cipaw na nyh khyh oh tou? Hynh-e hiinnaw te asekuhpaw byathan hae kha bya houh pia lanpaw nynh thua! <verse number="4" style="v" />Tukeiccuze tuhcihawpaw byathan hae kha na hoi oh ze, khriccaawbuu kya a um lei hae paw kha byapiatu lang na khang oh tou? <verse number="5" style="v" />Nae maethya ccaw cite nynh tuhte ka ho. Nanning kya zyntu lu kheit te lu kheit laku byapae kho lanpaw ahawpaw ccungccaw lu kheit san um khyh tou? <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama zyntu lu kheit nynh zyntu lu kheit kha kaethe zah zynleitu hae malang a thuakhae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze lu kheit te lu kheit na kaetheku oh paw tuh naemaw hanlan shungnaw nynh thua. Kaetheku laeze nae tungvaw ae cyisei oh paw kha hoyhua khyh tou? Pawccemou hynpyakunaw kha na teing paleih khyh oh? <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuhte thua leite naemaw ccaccei nynh zyntu hae tungvaw kya na sei oh zah lingte uccaw na luade oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hoyleinaw a raetu hae tuh Pachia peenaw kha ccou lan khyh hae cipaw na nyh khyh oh tou? Lingsakuh nan oh! A ohhuakuh hae paw, zohtuh beik hae paw, milae zu milae vawpaw a seikhae hae paw, nopi te nopi, pise te pise a sei hae paw, <verse number="10" style="v" />miruh hae, a karankuh hae paw, a rui hae paw, ccungccaw thethya ho hae paw, ccungccaw a luade hae paw mah Pachia peenaw ccou lan khyh hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Nanning kyaze abang tuh khahcihaw hae paw nynh na la thua oh. Thuasalama Bawipaw Jesu Khri min liate thuasah, ah Pachia Muisaw liate thuasah nanning tuh singpya na thua vae oh, thyaasah na thua vae oh zah thyaaccousah na thua vae oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pachia Phu-esah Oh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pawpaw balyn tuh ka hanlan cyi kho athua, thuasalama pawpaw balyn tuh athanepaw thua khyh. Pawpaw balyn tuh ka hanlan cyi kho athua, thuasalama pawpaw nynh mah kae hynh yn uk lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:23">1Ko 10.23</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Looh tuh vue hanlan thua zah vue tuh looh hanlan nynh thua. Thuasalama Pachia nynh tuh-e hae tuh parouh mawte a roh cih. Pyn tuh ohhuakunaw hanlan thua khyh, Bawipaw hanlan nynh thua, Bawipaw tuh pyn hanlan nynh thua. <verse number="14" style="v" />Pachia nynh Bawipaw kha a thoosah, aening hynh mah a thungnaw liate oun thoosah bua cih. <verse number="15" style="v" />Nae pyn tuh Khri pyn kya-e hae nynh thua cipaw na nyh khyh oh tou? Tukeiccuze Khri pyn kya-e hae kha ka lah cih zah ohhuanung pyn kya-e hae lang ka rae cih tou? Ka rae cceisoh! <verse number="16" style="v" />Ohhuanung te a kyngkuhpaw tuh tuh-e nung te pyn pynkheit nynh athua hae cipaw na nyh khyh oh tou? Pawccecize Pachia nynh, “Minmin lu ning tuh ngesaw kheit lang a tang cih hae,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Gen 2.24</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Thuasalama Bawipaw te a kyngkuhpaw tuh amaw te muisaw ccangkheit nynh athua hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Ohhuakunaw kha sibia oh! Ccungccaw nynh a raepaw seinaw miakaw tuh pyn atolang nynh a um; thuasalama ohhuakunaw a raepaw tuh amaw a pyn kya a sei vae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Nae pyn tuh Pachia kyate na mue oh paw, nae lungkhu a umpaw Thyaa Muisaw beikinn nynh thua cipaw te nanning tuh naemaw kya-e na thua khyh oh cipaw kha na nyh khyh oh tou?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:16">1Ko 3.16</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:16">2Ko 6.16</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" />Pawccecize nanning tuh amee te repaw nynh na thua oh; tukeiccuze Pachia phu-esah nawlan nae pyn kha mang oh.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Zuvaw Tangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Atu nanning nynh ka kalan nae zei oh paw te asekuh lante: “Pise nynh zudy leite a um ze ahoy,” na ci oh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Thuasalama ohhuakunaw kha sibia khylan pise miakaw nynh amaw a zu hoi sah lah, nopi miakaw nynh amaw a vawpaw hoi sah. <verse number="3" style="v" />Pise nynh vawpaw athuanawpaw a rya kha ccingsah sah lah, nopi nynh mah zu athuanawpaw a rya kha ccingsah sah; mih lu ning te mih rynaw kha lungryachikhaekuh kalang hae sah. <verse number="4" style="v" />Zu nynh amaw a pyn kya kaw hoi khyh, vawpaw nynh a hoi. Tuhawte vawpaw nynh mah amaw a pyn kya kaw hoi khyh, a zu nynh a hoi. <verse number="5" style="v" />Sawsangnaw rae khylan accyh sosoh na khyakuh oh zah nawccawkheih te na sibia oh paw laelan, lu kheit te lu kheit nae rynaw kha myapakuh nan oh; tuh-e ccyh he athang te, bua umkheih oh, tuhteze nynh na sungku kho khyh oh keiccuze Satan nynh ae tuhou lan khyh oh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama hynhte ka hopaw hynh kawbya kae pya oh paw thua leite, kae ua oh paw nynh thua. <verse number="7" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae balyn tuh kamaw hawte thua hae sah ci ka ry. Thuasalama ccungccaw miakaw nynh Pachia kyate muepaw lasung alokuh leipaw kha ccarou a hoi hae. Lu kheit nynh phuin kheit hoi zah mingccangpaw nynh ccangpaw phuin kheit kha a hoi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze zu a hoi leipaw, vawpaw a hoi leipaw te nomae hae kalan ka hopaw tuh: Minmin nynh kamaw hawte a um hae zetuh mih hanlan ahoy. <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin nynh a sungku kho khyh hae ze zu, vawpaw hoi hae sah; pawccecize chiisaw rynaw kha sungku kho khyh ze zu, vawpaw hoi tuh ahoyhua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zu, vawpaw a hoi hae paw kha kae nynh kaw ka pya hae, thuasalama tuh-e tuh kamaw kyate thua khyh, Bawipaw kyate yn thuapaw nynh thua: Zu nynh a vawpaw kha mah nan sah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.10-11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mat 5.32</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 19:9">19.9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mar 10.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16.18</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />A mya ze vawpaw hoi leite um sah, tuhkhyhze a vawpaw te bua ccawkuhthui hae sah. Vawpaw nynh a zu kha mah nan sah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw mingccang hae kalan, Bawipaw nynh thua leite, kae nynh ka hopaw tuh: zyntu lukhakheit nynh zynleitu athuanung kha zu lang hoi zah, tuh-e a zu nynh a vawpaw ryte umkheih lan a nawccaw ze, a zu kha mah nan sah. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuhawte nopi lukhakheit nynh zynleitu athuapaw vawpaw kha hoi zah tuh-e a vawpaw nynh a zu ryte umkheih lan a nawccaw ze, a vawpaw kha mah nan sah. <verse number="14" style="v" />Pawccecize a zyn leipaw vawpaw tuh a zu liate thyaasah thua zah, a zyn leipaw zu tuh a vawpaw liate thyaasah athua. Tukhyhze nae ccaaw hae tuh thyaa lan khyh hae, thuasalama atu minmin tuh athyaa hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuasalama a zyn leipaw nynh a mya ze, mah ccaleih sah. Zyntu raee thuasah, ccia thuasah tuhcihawpaw byathan kya heedeku lanpaw thua khyh. Pachia nynh nanning kha daenaw te um khylan nynh ae ko oh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Pou zu, na vawpaw kha na khum kho lanpaw te na khum kho lei lanpaw tuh pawtemou na ny? Pou vawpaw, na zu kha na khum kho lanpaw te na khum kho lei lanpaw tuh pawtemou na ny?</para>
  <para style="s1">Konaw thyhte Hiin Oh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pachia nynh nanning ae ko lya oh ze, Bawipaw nynh ae khyapya oh paw hiinnaw thyhte nanning lu raveih nynh hiin oh. E hynh khriccaawbuu hae balyn kya ka ccangpya hae paw nynh thua. <verse number="18" style="v" />Pachia nynh a ko lya vingdungawkuh vae paw a um tou? Vingdung a awkunaw adaelaepaw kha zosah lan zuakuh nan sah. Pachia nynh a ko lya vingdungawkuh leipaw a um tou? Vingdungawku lan zuakuh nan sah. <verse number="19" style="v" />Vingdungawkupaw tuh paw ccungkia khyh zah vingdungawku leipaw mah paw ccungkia khyh; thuasalama Pachia kawbya hae zuipaw nynh abyapi athua. <verse number="20" style="v" />Pachia nynh ae ko lya oh hawte nanning lu raveih nynh po hiin oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pachia nynh ae ko lya kha see na thua tou? Tuh-e kong tuh na thinphang nan sah. Thuasalama nang nynh luenaw na mue kho ze, tuh-e ccyhhoy tuh mangkuh. <verse number="22" style="v" />Pawccecize see athua lyakhe Bawipaw nynh a kopaw ccungccaw tuh Bawipaw ccungccaw a luepaw nynh thua. Tuhawte ko athua lyakhe a luepaw ccungccaw mah Khri see nynh thua. <verse number="23" style="v" />Nanning tuh amee te repaw nynh na thua oh; ccungccaw hae see lang tang nan oh. <verse number="24" style="v" />Uteno hae, Pachia nynh ae ko lya oh ze na thuanaw oh thyhte Pachia ryte po um oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Zu, Vawpaw Hoi leipaw te Nomae hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Atu zu, vawpaw a hoi lei hae paw te asekuh lante Bawipaw kawbya ka hoi khyh; tuhzemah kae tuh Bawipaw a ngaethyaumsahnaw kya zyn lan umpaw lu kheit ka thua hawte tuanaw kae pya oh. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuhte atu lya-e lungriathaenaw keiccuze pise lu kheit nynh tuhmawte po a um ze ahoy cite ka tua. <verse number="27" style="v" />Nang tuh zu te heede na thua tou? Lue lan zuakuh nan. Nang tuh zu dyku leite a luepaw na thua tou? Zu dyku lan zuakuh nan vae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Thuasalama nang tuh zu na hoi ze, na sei khyh; liaccady nynh vawpaw a hoi ze, aning tuh sei khyh. Tuhzemah zu, vawpaw a hoipaw tuh hynh-e hiinnaw kya vawsawnaw a tung cih hae, nanning kha tuh-e vawsawnaw kyate kae luesah ry oh. <verse number="29" style="v" />Thuasalama uteno hae, ka ho rypaw tuh, accyh adyn vae; tukeiccuze atu te vae tuh zu a hoi hae paw nynh zu a hoi lei hae paw hawte um hae sah; <verse number="30" style="v" />a rah hae paw nynh a rah lei hae paw hawte, lungtua hae paw nynh lungtua lei hae paw hawte, uccaw a re hae paw nynh uccaw a hoi lei hae paw hawte, <verse number="31" style="v" />hynh-e laephi uccaw te a ccuepekuh hae paw nynh tuh-e uccaw te a ccuepekuh lei hae paw hawte um hae sah; pawccecize hynh-e laephi muinsan tuh azo cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nanning kha lungriathaenaw kyate kae luesah ry oh. Zu hoi leipaw nynh tuh pawtemou Bawipaw kha a lungry ka tung cih cite Bawipaw ryalaw kong kha nynh a lungriathae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Thuasalama zu hoipaw nynh tuh pawtemou ka zu lungry ka tung cih cite laephi uccaw kong kha nynh a lungriathae. <verse number="34" style="v" />Vawpaw a hoipaw te liaccady laku mah alaenaw a um. Vawpaw a hoi leipaw nopi nynh tuh a pyn kya te a muisaw kya athyaa nawlan Bawipaw kya-e uccaw hae kha nynh a tua. Thuasalama vawpaw a hoipaw nopi nynh tuh pawtemou ka vawpaw lungry ka tung cih cite laephi uccaw hae kong kha nynh a tua. <verse number="35" style="v" />Hynhte ka hopaw tuh, nae hanlan athane nawlan nynh thua, nanning kha khee khylan thua leite, nanning nynh kou angaekuh lante na um nawlan oh te Bawipaw kha lungronaw um leite rya na lawpya nawlan oh nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Thuasalama pise lukhakheit nynh a haaw vae paw a liaccanung tungvaw dohoy lei lante nynh ka um cite a tuaku ze thuasah, a chiisaw rynaw eih le zah umkheih lan accanthya vae ze thuasah a ry hawte zuvaw lang tang hae sah; tuh-e tuh seinaw thua khyh. Minmin tuh zuvaw lang tang hae sah. <verse number="37" style="v" />Thuasalama tynkaring lan tuakuh zah, nangseku leite a rynaw kha a sungku kho keiccuze tuh-e nopinung tuh a liaccanung lante kyalya po nung lan cite a thinlung kya bya a paekuhpaw tuh uccaw hoypaw nynh a rae. <verse number="38" style="v" />Tukeiccuze a haaw vae paw a liaccanung kha zu lang a hoikuhpaw tuh uccaw hoypaw hynh a rae; thuasalama zu a hoi leipaw ccungccaw tuh houh hoypaw uccaw kha a rae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Zu tuh a vawpaw a hiin lungkhu balyn heede athua. Thuasalama a vawpaw tuh a chi lanze, a rypaw pise zu lang tang khylan, Bawipaw kya kyalya nynh aning tuh a lue. <verse number="40" style="v" />Thuasalama kae nynh bya ka paenaw tetuh, aning nynh vawpaw hoi leite khamawte a um lanze a lungtuahua cih. Kae mah Pachia Muisaw ka hoi cite ka tuakuh.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Zohtuh hae kalan Looh Pyanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Atu zohtuh hae kalan pyapaw looh konglang ho lanze: “aening balyn tuh nynaw ah hoi oh” cipaw ah ny oh. Nynaw tuh a lysakuh, thuasalama sungsakunaw nynh tuh thawzung kha a tynsah. <verse number="2" style="v" />Lukhakheit nynh ccangkhakheit ka nyh cite a tuaku lanze, ny lan accan zeih kha nyh loh khyh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Thuasalama Pachia a sungsahpaw ccungccaw kha Pachia nynh a ny.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tukeiccuze zohtuh kalan a pya hae paw looh aenaw konglang ho lanze, laephi kya zohtuh um ccaccing khyh cipaw te Pachia ccangkheit laelan ccangpaw um vae khyh cipaw kha ah ny oh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Pawccecize “pachia hae” patae te “bawi hae” patae a um a ci hae hawte, vaawlang kya thuasah, laephi vawlan thuasah pachia hae a ci hae paw kha a la um hae zemah, <verse number="6" style="v" />aening hanlan tuh Paaw, Pachia ccangkheit rou nynh a um, pawpaw balyn tuh amaw kyate oun um zah, aening tuh amaw hanlan nynh ah hiin oh. Bawipaw lu kheit, Jesu Khri rou nynh a um. Pawpaw balyn tuh amaw liate um zah, aening mah amaw liate nynh ah um oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuhzemah tuh-e nynaw tuh ccungccaw miakaw kya um khyh. Abang ccungccaw tuh atu cia zohtuh beiknaw kya a ciaku hae keiccuze zohtuh kalan pyapaw looh kha a ae hae ze, zohtuh looh nynh thua cite a tua hae; mimaw te mimaw nykunawpaw thinlung tuh a thawzya keiccuze tuh-e looh nynh oun thusah cite a tua hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Looh nynh aening hynh Pachia kalan oun naesakuh hua lan khyh. Ah ae khyh oh zemah ah shunghua lae khyh oh, ah ae oh zemah ah miahua lae khyh oh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuasalama nae kya-e hynh-e luenaw hynh thawzya hae paw hanlan thyku nawlan a tang khyh nawlan raeringkuh oh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Pawccecize nynaw na hoi oh paw nanning nynh zohtuh beikinn kya looh na ae oh paw kha mingccang hae nynh ae muih oh ze, mimaw nykunawpaw thinlung thawzya hae paw nynh zohtuh hae kalan pyapaw looh kha ae lan mih rawthung lan khyh tou? <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nae kya-e nynaw keiccuze, Khri nynh mih hanlan a chipya hae paw, thawzyapaw zyntu hae tuh arohhang cih hae tou? <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuhcite nae uno hae tungvaw na sei oh zah mimaw nykunawpaw thinlung a thawzya ccyh lyakhe vaemaw he na muesah oh tuh, Khri tungvaw na sei vae oh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tukeiccuze looh nynh ka uno kha a khuliasaku lanze, ka uno kha ka khuliasaku khyh nawlan, saw kha kharouh ka ae vae lan khyh.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Locceihtu A Rya te A Ccou lanpaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kae tuh a luepaw ka thua khyh tou? Locceihtu ka thua khyh tou? Ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri kha kae nyn ka muih boi khyh tou? Nanning tuh Bawipaw kya ka lawpaw ka ryalaw na thua khyh oh tou? <verse number="2" style="v" />Kae tuh mingccang hae hanlan locceihtu ka thua khyh zemah, nanning hanlan tuh locceihtu nynh ka thua; pawccecize nanning tuh Bawipaw kya locceihtu ka thuanawpaw tazeih nynh na thua oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Akaw-aleih bya yn khiatu hae kya ka daangsahku nawpaw bya tuh hynhte nynh thua: <verse number="4" style="v" />Kaening tuh aenaw kaw te nianaw kaw kae hoi khyh tou? <verse number="5" style="v" />Ccangpaw locceihtu hae hawte, Bawipaw a neitaw hae te Sefas hawte, kaening so khua kae ccongnaw kya a zynpaw zu lu kheit kha hoeibuanaw kaw kae hoibua khyh tou? <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuhkhyhze Barnabas te kae kyalya tou vuekuakunaw hanlan ryalaw lawku leite um lan kaw kae hoibua khyh? <verse number="7" style="v" />Hummou amaw a phua kha mangte rhawkaw rya a lah? Hummou misu khokhu kya ccoukuh zah misu thae ae leite a um? Tuhkhyhze hummou tuuphu kha rin zah tuu matei kha nia leite a um?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />E bya hynh ccungccaw muihnaw tetou hung ka ho? Kawbya nynh mah hynhte hobua khyh tou? <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawccecize Moses Kawbya kyaze, “Ccatan a tin cciamangpaw tangnuapaw mung kha na bucceih lan khyh,” cite azeikuh. Pachia nynh tangnuapaw hanlan tou a peki?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Deu 25.4</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1Ti 5.18</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuhkhyhze tuh-e tuh aening hanlan kyalya ho khyh tou? Aening hanlan nynh tuhte azeiku; pawccecize leithuetupaw nynh ngaehoinaw te thue lan ccan zah, ccatan a tintupaw nynh a muebua lanpaw ccathae kha ngaehoinaw te tin lan accan. <verse number="11" style="v" />Kaening nynh nae kyakhe muisaw ccacii kae tu zah nae kya-e pynsaw uccaw hae kha kae rue ze, myaryamaw alung tou?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:27">Rom 15.27</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Mingccang hae nynh nanning kya tuh-e kaw tuh a mue hae ze, kaening tuh houh muehua lan kae ccan khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="p">Tuhzemah kaening nynh tuh-e kaw tuh kae mang khyh; Khri thehoypaw hynh khawtu a umsei khyh nawlan pawpaw balyn kha phang kae ngaesang. <verse number="13" style="v" />Beikinn kya ryalah hae paw tuh beikinn kyate looh a mue hae cipaw te silawhang kya ryalah hae paw tuh silawhang vawlan e silawnawpaw kha a ccoubua hae cipaw kha na nyh khyh oh tou?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:1">Deu 18.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuhawte thehoypaw a phytu hae tuh thehoypaw liate mih vuekuakuh cih hae cite Bawipaw nynh kaw a pya vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:10">Mat 10.10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:7">Luk 10.7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuasalama hynh-e hae hynh kharouh ka mang khyh, tuhte nae cyipya oh ccaw cite mah hynh-e ccaw hynh ka zei khyh. Pawccecize ka pookunawpaw hynh lukhakheit nynh accakaepaw lang a tangsah lae tuh ka chi ze ahoyhua. <verse number="16" style="v" />Thehoypaw ka ho zemah pooku lanpaw ka hoi khyh, pawccecize ho lanpaw rya ka hoi. Thehoypaw ka ho khyh lanze, kae tuh pawcih ngaethya lan umpaw pei ka thua cih! <verse number="17" style="v" />Pawccecize e rya hynh lungthote ka law ze, ryalaw mee ka mue cih; thuasalama kamaw rynaw kha rawsete ka law lanze, kae kha yn zyn zah yn nawtupaw ryalaw nynh thua. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuhteze ka ryalaw mee tuh pawmou? Ka ryalaw mee tuh, thehoypaw ka ho vae ze, ka hoipaw kaw kha alawe lante mang leite, thehoypaw kha amee hoku leite ka hopaw kha nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pawccecize kae tuh ccungccaw balyn kyate ka lue zemah ccungccaw hae kha houh lung lan mue khylan, ccungccaw balyn hanlan kamaw te kamaw kha see lang nynh ka tansaku. <verse number="20" style="v" />Judah hae kha mue khylan kae tuh Judah hae kya Judah paw lang nynh ka tang; Kawbya zakaw um hae paw kha mue khylan kae tuh Kawbya zakaw um hae paw kya Kawbya zakaw umpaw lang nynh ka tang. <verse number="21" style="v" />(Kae tuh Pachia kawbya kyate a lue leipaw, Khri kawbya zakaw a umpaw ka thua zemah), Kawbya atolang um hae paw kha mue khylan kae tuh Kawbya atolang a umpaw lang nynh ka tang. <verse number="22" style="v" />Thawzya hae paw kha mue khylan kae tuh thawzyapaw lang nynh ka tang. Ccungccaw abang kha aphuinphuin te khum khylan kae tuh ccungccaw balyn hanlan atyn-are lang nynh ka tang. <verse number="23" style="v" />Kae tuh thehoypaw a hythuanaw kha ka ccoubua nawlan, thehoypaw keiccuze hynh-e hae balyn hynh ka cyi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ccuetaekunaw kya a ccue hae paw tuh mih balynte ccue hae salamah lu kheit kyalya nynh lasung a mue cipaw na nyh khyh oh tou? Tukeiccuze lasung na mue ccaw oh tuhcite ccue oh. <verse number="25" style="v" />Khungtaekunaw kya a taekuh buapaw miakaw nynh tuh tynre balyn kya amaw te amaw a sungku; anaan-arohthyapaw haetapaw lukhung mue khylan nynh tuhte a cyi hae; thuasalama aening tuh anaan-arohthya leipaw lukhung mue khylan nynh thua. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tukeiccuze kae tuh eenaw a um leite ka ccue khyh; thungku a thyapaw nynh khivae kha a thung hawte ka thung khyh. <verse number="27" style="v" />Thuasalama ming hae kha ka hopah kou hae te, kamaw tuh a shungpaw lang ka tangsei khyh nawlan, ka pyn hynh ka kia zah ka uk.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Zohtuh kha Raeringkuh Oh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Uteno hae, ah minpaaw hae kya acyihkuhpaw kha ny leite na um lan oh paw ka ry khyh; ah minpaaw hae balyn tuh maeking kaw la um hae zah mih balynte rili kha po la zua hae,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:21-22">Exo 13.21-22</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 14:22-29">14.22-29</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />maeking kya te rili kyakhe mih balynte Moses kya baptisma a in hae, <verse number="3" style="v" />mih balynte phuin kheitpaw muisaw looh kha la ae hae zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:35">Exo 16.35</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />mih balynte phuin kheitpaw muisaw tui kha a la neih hae. Pawccecize mih nulang te azuikuhpaw muisaw lungpi kyate a poupaw muisaw tui kha nynh a nia hae, tuh-e lungpi tuh Khri nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:6">Exo 17.6</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 20:11">Nam 20.11</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin kyaze alunghua tungvaw kya Pachia a lungrythua khyh, tukeiccuze minmin tuh ramkaw kya a chih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:29-30">Nam 14.29-30</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Minmin nynh ahoy leipaw uccaw hae kha a duaa hae hawte aening nynh ah duaa khyh nawlan oh, atu hynh-e hae tuh aening hanlan dosuinku lanpaw nynh thua hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:4">Nam 11.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Ccathyaa kyaze, “Ccungccaw hae tuh ae khylan te nia khylan dahung hae zah zue khylan bua a thokuh hae,” cite azeiku hawte, nanning tuh minmin abang hawte zohtuh beiktu hae thua nan oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:6">Exo 32.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Minmin abang tuh ohhuakunaw rae hae zah nin kheit lungkhu thong kuin thong thum a chi hae hawte, aening tuh ohhuakunaw rae nan oh sih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:1-18">Nam 25.1-18</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Minmin abang nynh Pachia kha syntawtua hae zah hupaw nynh a ro hae hawte, aening tuh Khri kha syntawtua nan oh sih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:5-6">Nam 21.5-6</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Minmin abang nynh ccohkuh hae zah a rohtupaw nynh a ro hae hawte, nanning tuh ccohkuh bua nan oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:41-49">Nam 16.41-49</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Hynh-e hae balyn hynh dosuinkupaw lang a tang nawlan minmin kya acyikuh. She athangnaw nynh a thuanuapaw aening thuiheinaw hanlan nynh tuh-e hae tuh zei athua. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka thadyn cite a tuakuhpaw nynh tuh a khuliaku khyh nawlan raeringkuh sah. <verse number="13" style="v" />Ccungccaw miakaw nynh a tung hae paw syntawnaw rou kha nynh na tung oh. Pachia tuh a lungzipaw thua zah, na taening lei oh paw syntawnaw kha nae kya thuasah lan khyh; syntawnaw kha na teing kho nawlan oh, syntawnaw ryte luenawpaw laanpi kha mah ae raepah cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka sungsah hae, zohtuh beiknaw kha ccuetaw oh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahawpaw ccungccaw hae kya ho hawte nynh kae hopya oh; ka hopaw hynh nanning nynh la tuasekuh oh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Hythua ah pya oh paw hythuanaw banang tuh Khri chiise kha ah neethungku oh paw thua khyh tou? Ah iathungku oh paw sanlou tuh Khri pyn kha ah neethungku oh paw thua khyh tou?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:26-28">Mat 26.26-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-24">Mar 14.22-24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:19-20">Luk 22.19-20</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Sanlou phe kheit kyalya athua keiccuze aening tuh patae ah ci oh zemah pyn pynkheit nynh ah thua oh; pawccecize aening balyn tuh tuh-e sanlou phe kheitpaw kha nynh ah mangkheih oh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel hae kha dotua oh; silawnaw hae paw a ae hae paw tuh silawhang kya ryalahbua hae paw thua khyh hae tou?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 7:6">Lev 7.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuhteze ka ho rypaw tuh pawmou? Zohtuh hae kalan silawnawpaw looh thuasah, tuh-e zohtuh thuasah abyapipaw nynh thua ka ci tou? <verse number="20" style="v" />Thuasalama lawki hae nynh silawnaw hae paw tuh Pachia kalan thua leite, raerangsaro hae kalan nynh si a law hae. Raerangsaro hae ryte vaeccawtang hae paw lang kae tangsah ry khyh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:17">Deu 32.17</ref> (LXX)</char></note> <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawipaw banang te raerangsaro hae banang kha na neihkheih kho khyh oh; Bawipaw ccaboi te raerangsaro hae ccaboi kha na mangkheih kho khyh oh. <verse number="22" style="v" />Aening nynh Bawipaw kha eiungnaw ah hoisah cih oh tou? Aening tuh aning laeze ah thawsaehua tou?</para>
  <para style="s1">Pachia Phu-e nawlan Cyih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Pawpaw balyn kae cyi kho,” a ci hae, thuasalama pawpaw balyn hynh marya athanepaw thua khyh. “Pawpaw balyn kae cyi kho,” a ci hae, thuasalama pawpaw balyn hynh bawmtu thua khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:12">1Ko 6.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v" />Namaw hanlan thanenaw kha ccungkuh nan; ming hae hanlan thanenaw kha ccungtua. <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahmaw nykunaw thinlung keiccu byakhia leite, saw zuanaw kya a zua hae paw miakaw kha ae oh; <verse number="26" style="v" />pawccecize, Ccathyaa nynh, “laephi te a lungkhu umpaw balyn tuh Bawipaw kya-e nynh thua,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 24:1">Sam 24.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="27" style="v" />A zyn leipaw lukhakheit nynh aepaw ae kopah oh zah ccia lan na ry oh ze, ahmaw nykunaw thinlung keiccu byakhia leite, nae malang ae nyapya hae paw miakaw kha ae oh. <verse number="28" style="v" />Thuasalama lukhakheit nynh, “E tuh zohtuh hae kalan pyapaw nynh thua,” cite ae hopya oh ze, khate ae hopahpaw keiccu thuasah, ahmaw nykunaw thinlung keiccu thuasah tuh-e tuh ae nan oh. <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahmaw nykunaw thinlung ka cipaw hynh namaw thinlung kha thua leite, mingccang hae thinlung kha nynh ka ho ry. Pawccemou mingccangpaw kya-e nykunaw thinlung nynh kae ka luenaw kha bya yn pia lanpaw tuh? <verse number="30" style="v" />Lungtuabya hote ka ae lanze, lungtuabya hote ka aepaw tuh-e looh keiccuze pawccemou kae tuh thethya yn ho hae?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tukeiccuze na ae oh zemah thuasah, na nia oh zemah thuasah, pawpaw na cyi oh zemah, pawpaw balyn tuh Pachia phu-enaw hanlan cyih oh. <verse number="32" style="v" />Judah hae, Grik hae te Pachia khriccaawbuu kha vawsawnaw pya nan oh. <verse number="33" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae nynh khumnaw a muebua hae ccaw cite, kamaw elang thanenaw ccungku leite, ccungccaw patae elang thanenaw ka ccung zah, ka cyipaw miakaw kya ccungccaw balyn kha lunghoysah khylan ka zuaku hawte nanning mah cyihbua oh.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kae nynh Khri kha ka dosuinku hawte nanning mah kae hynh oun dosuinkuh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:16">1Ko 4.16</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:17">Fil 3.17</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Lu Bongkunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Uteno hae, nanning nynh pawpaw kya balyn kae kha nae liathui oh zah, nae kalan kae ap oh phungzae hae thyhte na zui oh keiccuze kae thehoysah oh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Thuasalama Khri tuh pise miakaw lu thua zah, vawpaw tuh a zu lu nynh thua cipaw te Pachia tuh Khri lu nynh thua cipaw kha kae nysah ry oh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Pise lu kheit nynh a lu bongkute sawsang ze thuasah, profehbya a ho ze thuasah amaw a lu kha thethyasahpaw nynh thua. <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuasalama nopi lu kheit nynh a lu bongku leite sawsang ze thuasah, profehbya a ho ze thuasah, amaw a lu kha thethyasahpaw nynh thua; pawccecize tuhte a cyi ze, a lu-opaw te nynh aloku. <verse number="6" style="v" />Pawccecize nopi nynh a lu kha a bongku khyh ze, a sang ngokuh sah; nopi lu kheit hanlan sang ngokupaw, lu-okupaw tuh maethya lan um ze, a lu kha bongkuh sah. <verse number="7" style="v" />Pise tuh Pachia muinsan te a phu-enaw athua keiccuze a lu bongku lan ccan khyh. Thuasalama nopi tuh pise phu-enaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26-27">Gen 1.26-27</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Pawccecize pise tuh nopi kyate raepaw thua khyh, nopi tuh pise kyate raepaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.8-9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:18-23">Gen 2.18-23</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Pise tuh nopi hanlan raepaw thua khyh, nopi tuh pise hanlan raepaw nynh thua. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tukeiccuze vaaw hae keiccuze nopi nynh a lu vawlan kawhoinaw syntawnaw a hoi aho. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuhzemah Bawipaw kya nopi leite pise um khyh, pise leite nopi mah um khyh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Pawccecize nopi tuh pise kyate yn thua hawte, pise mah nopi liate nynh yn thua; thuasalama pawpaw balyn tuh Pachia kyate nynh oun thua hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Naemaw te naemaw byapiatua oh: nopi nynh lu bongku leite Pachia kalan sawsangpaw tuh angaekuh tou, ngaekuh khyh tou? <verse number="14" style="v" />Pise nynh a sang kha myarya sae lan a hangku ze, amaw hanlan maethyaum cipaw laephi phung nynh ae ccangpah khyh oh tou? <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuasalama nopi nynh a sang kha myarya sae lan a hangku ze, amaw hanlan phu-enaw nynh thua. Pawccecize a sang tuh amaw bongku nawlan pyapaw nynh thua. <verse number="16" style="v" />Thuasalama lukhakheit nynh a ei ry ze, tuhcihawpaw phung ah hoi khyh oh, Pachia khriccaawbuu hae mah hoi khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Bawipaw Zerya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">Mat 26.26-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Mar 14.22-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-23">Luk 22.14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Akawlan e thuiheinaw kya nanning kha kae thehoysah khyh oh, pawccecize nanning nynh na sueluaku vae oh ze, ahoypaw hanlan thua leite athahpaw hanlan nynh athuahua. <verse number="18" style="v" />Pawccecize masaty lanze, khriccaawbuu buukheit lante na sueluaku vae oh ze, nae laku phiakunaw a um cite ka thae; tuh-e tuh abang-asung ka zyn. <verse number="19" style="v" />Pawccecize nanning kya ahmepaw ccungccaw hae kha langsaku khylan, nae kya buu phiakunaw mah a um cih. <verse number="20" style="v" />Nanning nynh he na sueluaku vae oh ze, tuh-e tuh Bawipaw zerya mang khylan na sueluaku oh paw thua ccaccing khyh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Pawccecize ae ccyh he thua te, nanning lu raveih nynh naemaw looh kha lawkute na ae oh keiccuze lu kheit tuh a vuelaw zah mingccangpaw tuh a rui. <verse number="22" style="v" />Pawmou na cyi oh? Aenaw lanpaw te nianaw lanpaw inn na hoi khyh oh tou? Tuhkhyhze Pachia khriccaawbuu kha na dothatheih oh zah ryachi hae kha maethya na bong oh tou? Pawte kae hopah cih oh? Hynh-e kya kae thehoysah cih oh tou? Kae thehoysah lan khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pawccecize nae kalan kae ccangpya oh paw hynh Bawipaw kyate ka muepaw nynh thua: Bawipaw Jesu nynh amaw a phee khuazi hae khe sanlou kha lah zah, <verse number="24" style="v" />lungtuabya a ho koute, sanlou kha eih zah, “Hynh-e hynh ka pyn nynh thua, nanning hanlan nynh thua. Kamaw liathui nawlan ae oh,” a ci. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuhawte zerya a mang kou hae te, banang kha mah lah zah, “Hynh-e banang tuh ka chii kya atynpaw byakin thawpaw nynh thua. E hynh na nia takyh oh te, kamaw liathui nawlan neih oh,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:6-8">Exo 24.6-8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Jer 31.31-34</ref></char></note> <verse number="26" style="v" />Pawccecize nanning nynh hynh-e sanlou na ae takyh oh te hynh-e banang na nia takyh vae oh ze, Bawipaw a chinaw kong kha amaw yn thua mawlaezung na phy oh paw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tukeiccuze humhung zemah Bawipaw sanlou te banang kha angaekuh lei lante ae zah a neihpaw miakaw tuh Bawipaw a pyn te a chii kya seinaw a raepaw nynh thua. <verse number="28" style="v" />Tukeiccuze naemaw te naemaw hoyte tuakuh ty oh, tukoute sanlou kha ae oh lah banang kha neih oh. <verse number="29" style="v" />Pawccecize Bawipaw pyn asuilan kha nythya leite, ae zah a neihpaw miakaw tuh a tungvaw byapiaku khylan ae zah a neihpaw nynh thua. <verse number="30" style="v" />Hynh-e keiccuze nanning lakuze ccungccaw patae tuh mih thawzya zah a ccih hae, abang tuh a chih hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Pawccecize ahmaw te ahmaw kha bya ah piaku oh ze, aening kha bya oun pia vae lan khyh hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Thuasalama Bawipaw nynh aening kha bya he oun pia te, aening tuh laephi ccungccaw hae ryte seibe ah thua khyh nawlan oh, oun thuiheipaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka uteno hae, ae lan na sueluaku vae oh ze, lu kheit te lu kheit la ngawkuh bua oh. <verse number="34" style="v" />Nae vuelaw ze innvaw kya aesya oh, tuhteze nynh he na pumkuh oh te, byapianaw na ing lan khyh oh. Ccangpaw konglang tuh kamaw kae thua te, kae ccangpah cih oh.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Muisaw Lasung hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Uteno hae, nanning nynh muisaw lasung hae konglang ny leite na um lan oh paw ka ry khyh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Lawki lang na tang lya oh tuh, nanning kha ae la soih oh zah byahothya leipaw zohtuh hae kalan ae la thuakhae sei oh paw kha na ny oh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Pachia Muisaw liate a hopaw ccungccaw nynh tuh, “Jesu tuh thyalawnaw tung sah!” cite ho boi khyh, te Thyaa Muisaw liate holeite hum nynh sanmah, “Jesu tuh Bawipaw nynh thua,” cite ho kho khyh cipaw kha thaethya oh ci ka ry.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lasung tuh aphuinphuin a um zemah Muisaw ccangkheit rou nynh a um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.4-11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:6-8">Rom 12.6-8</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Pachia ryalawnaw tuh aphuinphuin a um zemah Bawipaw lu kheit rou nynh a um. <verse number="6" style="v" />Ryalawpaw tuh aphuinphuin a um zemah ccungccaw miakaw kya atyn-are ryalahpaw Pachia lu kheit rou nynh a um. <verse number="7" style="v" />Ccungccaw balyn hoynaw hanlan milu raveih kya Muisaw langkunaw kaw kha pya athua. <verse number="8" style="v" />Muisaw liate ccungccaw lu kheit kha hawnaw byahothyanaw pya zah, tuh-e Muisaw liate mingccangpaw kha nynaw byakhupaw hothyanaw kha a pya. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuh-e Muisaw liate mingccangpaw kha zynnaw pya zah, tuh-e Muisaw liate mingccangpaw kha ngeccih dansahnaw lasung kha a pya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Mingccangpaw kha ngaeangnaw rae khonaw pya zah, mingccangpaw kha profehbya ho khonaw a pya, mingccangpaw kha muisaw hae phiathyanaw a pya; mingccangpaw kha bya hae aphuinphuin hothyanaw a pya, mingccangpaw kha bya hae asuilan ccaesah thyanaw a pya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Hynh-e hae balyn hynh tuh-e Muisaw ccangkheit nynh ryalawpaw thua zah, a ry hawte milu raveih kha ccarou a neethung hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pyn kya-e hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pyn pynkheit kyakhe pyn kya-e hae patae um hae zah, pyn kya-e hae balyn tuh alung hae zemah pyn pynkheit athua hae hawte, Khri mah tuhawte nynh athua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:4-5">Rom 12.4-5</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Pawccecize Judah thuasah, Grik thuasah, see thuasah, aluepaw ccungccaw thuasah, aening balyn tuh Muisaw ccangkheit liate pyn pynkheit lungkhu lang baptisma insah ah thua oh; ah balynte Muisaw ccangkheit kha nia lan pya ah thua oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pawccecize pyn tuh pyn kya-e ccangkheit kyalya um leite, aranphei patae a um. <verse number="15" style="v" />Ccu nynh, “Kae tuh kuih ka thua khyh keiccuze pyn te kae sekuh khyh,” a ci lanze, tuhte a cinaw nynh pyn kya-e athuanaw kha zyasah lae lan khyh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Nakua nynh, “Kae tuh mit ka thua khyh keiccuze pyn te kae sekuh khyh,” a ci lanze, tuhte a cinaw nynh pyn kya-e athuanaw kha zyasah lae lan khyh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Pyn abalyn mawte mit a la thua lanze, pawkyamou thaenaw tuh a um vae cih? Pyn abalyn mawte nakua a la thua lanze, paw kyate mou amyn tuh a thae vae cih? <verse number="18" style="v" />Thuasalama atu tuh Pachia nynh amaw a lungry hawte pyn kya-e hae miakaw kha mih umnaw raveih kyakhe pong a nung hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Minmin balyn tuh pyn kya-e ccangkheit kyalya a la thua hae ze, pyn tuh pawkyamou a um vae cih? <verse number="20" style="v" />Atu tuh pyn kya-e hae tuh patae a um hae zemah pyn tuh pynkheit rou nynh a um. <verse number="21" style="v" />Mit nynh kuih kha, “Nang tuh kae peki khyh,” ci kho lan khyh. Tuhawte lu nynh ccu kha, “Nang tuh kae peki khyh,” ci kho lan khyh. <verse number="22" style="v" />Thanccingte ho lanze, thawzya huapaw alopaw pyn kya-e hae tuh houh ahoboupaw nynh thua hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Pyn kyaze sawtua lan eih um khyh cite ah tua oh paw aranphei kha sawtuanaw houh ah pya oh; ah pyn kyaze dohoy leipaw kha houh puithya lan ah ccaan oh. <verse number="24" style="v" />Ah pyn kyaze dohoypaw kha tuh ccaan ho vae khyh. Thuasalama pyn kyaze sawtuanaw aboupaw aranphei kha sawtuanaw alehua pyate Pachia nynh pyn kha a rae; <verse number="25" style="v" />pyn lungkhu kya phiakunaw um leite, aranphei hae nynh ccangkheit te ccangkheit alokuhpaw do-oihkunaw a hoi nawlan hae nynh tuhte a rae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Pyn kya-e ccangkheit nynh a teing ze, mih balyn mawte a teingbua hae; pyn kya-e ccangkheit tuh sawtuanaw a ccou ze, mih balyn mawte mih lungtuabua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Atu nanning tuh Khri pyn na thua oh zah, lu raveihte tuh-e pyn kya-e hae nynh na thua oh. <verse number="28" style="v" />Pachia nynh masaty locceihtu hae, ccangningnaw profeh hae, ccangthumnaw ccangpahtu hae, tukoute ngaeangnaw a rae hae paw, tukoute ngeccih dansahnaw lasung a mue hae paw, ming hae a bawm hae paw, ming hae a ukthya hae paw, bya aphuinphuin a hothya hae paw kha khriccaawbuu kya ryalaw a pya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:11">Efe 4.11</ref></char></note> <verse number="29" style="v" />Mih balynte locceihtu athua hae tou? Mih balynte profeh athua hae tou? Mih balynte ccangpahtu athua hae tou? Mih balynte ngaeangnaw a rae hae tou? <verse number="30" style="v" />Mih balynte ngeccih dansahnaw lasung a mue hae tou? Mih balynte bya aphuinphuin a ho hae tou? Mih balynte bya a leih hae tou? <verse number="31" style="v" />Thuasalama ahoy huapaw lasung hae kha mue lan zuakuh oh. Te ahoy huaccepaw laanpi kha kae muihsah ung cih oh.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Sungsakunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae bya te vaaw hae bya kha ka hothya salamah sungsakunaw ka hoi khyh ze, kae tuh dawkhua tupaw roi te lanchi khuapaw roi hawte nynh ka thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Kae nynh profehbya ho khonaw thungnaw ka hoi zah byakhupaw balyn te nynaw balyn kha ka thaethya zemah thuasah, mua hae nuesaku khonaw zynnaw balyn ka hoi zemah thuasah, sungsakunaw ka hoi khyh ze, kae tuh accakaepaw nynh ka thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mat 17.20</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 21:21">21.21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:23">Mar 11.23</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka hoipaw balyn kha ming hae ka pya hae zemah thuasah, ka pyn hynh maee te uku lan ciate ka pyaku zemah thuasah sungsakunaw ka hoi khyh ze, tuh-e nynh ka hanlan pawsang thane khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sungsakunaw tuh a lungsae zah thawccinaw a hoi; sungsakunaw tuh eiungnaw hoi khyh; sungsakunaw tuh pookuh khyh, lysakuh khyh, <verse number="5" style="v" />a othah khyh. Amaw thanenaw hanlan ccungkuh khyh, a thinriathya khyh, cyiseinaw kha phang ccyke khyh; <verse number="6" style="v" />hoyleinaw kya a lungtua khyh, thuasalama byaccing kya a lungtua; <verse number="7" style="v" />sungsakunaw tuh pawpaw balyn kha a ngaesang kho, pawpaw balyn kha a zyn, pawpaw balyn kha a ngaehoi, pawpaw balyn kha phang a ngaesang.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sungsakunaw tuh thang boi khyh. Thuasalama profehbya ho khonaw a um zemah a zo cih; bya aphuinphuin hothyanaw a um zemah adae cih; nynaw a um zemah a zo cih. <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawccecize aening tuh abang-asung nynh ah ny oh, abang-asung nynh profehbya ah ho oh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuasalama accingpaw he yn thua vae tetuh, abang-asungpaw kha tuh a zo cih hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka imua lya tuh imua hawte nynh bya ka ho, imua hawte ka nyh zah imua hawte nynh ka tua; thuasalama piccan ka thua tetuh imua uccaw hae kha pong ka vua vae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Pawccecize atu aening tuh muinsado kya valyvaly te nynh ah muih oh; thuasalama tuin ccyh vae tuh mitmae hawiliakute muih lan vae. Atu kae tuh abang-asung nynh ka ny, thuasalama tuin ccyh vae tuh Pachia nynh kae hynh phe ccing lan yn ny hawte kae mah phe ccing lan ka nyh vae cih. <verse number="13" style="v" />Atu tuh zynnaw, ngaehoinaw te sungsakunaw, hynh-e hae ccangthum hynh atyn; hynh-e hae kyaze abyapi huaccepaw tuh sungsakunaw nynh thua.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Profehbya Hopaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sungsakunaw kha deehui oh lah, muisaw lasung hae kha mue lan peki oh, abyapi lante profehbya na ho kho nawlan oh peki oh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Pawccecize thae leipaw bya a hopaw tuh ccungccaw hae kalan ho khyh, Pachia kalan nynh a ho. Pawccecize a hopaw bya kha hum nynh sanmah thaethya khyh; Muisaw liate byakhupaw hae kha nynh a ho. <verse number="3" style="v" />Profehbya a hopaw tuh ccungccaw hae kha thawzung tynsahnaw, hyynawpaw te ngaengansahnaw bya kha nynh a hopya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Thae leipaw bya a hopaw tuh amaw kyalya kha nynh thawzung a tynsaku. Thuasalama profehbya a hopaw tuh khriccaawbuu kha thawzung a tynsah. <verse number="5" style="v" />Nae balynte thae leipaw bya kha ho oh ci ka ry, thuasalama profehbya na ho nawlan oh houh ka ryhua. Pawccecize thae leipaw bya a hopaw nynh khriccaawbuu kha thawzung tynsah nawlan asuilan kha ccaerarih lan a leih khyh ze, aning laeze profehbya a hopaw tuh aphutehua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Uteno hae, atu nae kalan kae thua zah thae leipaw bya te ka ho zemah byaphy liate thuasah, nynaw liate thuasah, profehbya honaw liate thuasah, ccangpyakunaw liate thuasah kae hopya khyh oh ze nae hanlan pawmou athane cih? <verse number="7" style="v" />Hiinnaw hoi leite a ccaethya hae paw phyly thuasah, tintang thuasah a roi kha ccaerarih lan accae khyhze, phyly tou a tu hae, tintang tou a khua hae cipaw kha pawtemou ny kho a um cih? <verse number="8" style="v" />Mungkae nynh ccaerarih lan roi accae khyh ze, hum nynh mou rhawtuk lan a paccynkuh cih? <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuhawte nanning mah thaethya lan azoipaw bya hae khate na ho khyh oh ze, na ho oh paw kha pawtemou a nyh cih hae? Khivae kalan nynh hung na hohan cih oh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Laephi vawlan bya aphuin patae a um, asuilan a hoi leipaw bya phuin kheit san um khyh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze bya asuilan kha kae nynh ka ny khyh ze, tuh-e bya a hopaw hanlan kae tuh ramccangpaw nynh ka thua vae cih, a hotupaw mah kae ka hanlan ramccangpaw nynh athua cih. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuhawte nanning mah muisaw lasung hae myarya a pekipaw na thua oh keiccuze, khriccaawbuu thawzung tynsahnaw elang tuh-e lasung kha phe ccing lan hoi lan zuakuh oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tukeiccuze thae leipaw bya a hopaw nynh tuh-e tuh asuilan aleih kho nawlan sawsangkuh sah. <verse number="14" style="v" />Pawccecize kae nynh thae leipaw bya te saw ka sang ze, ka muisaw nynh saw a sang, thuasalama ka thinlung tuh tuin kya panbua khyh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuhteze pawte ka cyih cih? Kae tuh muisaw te saw ka sang cih zah thinlung te mah saw ka sang cih; muisaw te hlaw ka sah cih zah thinlung te mah hlaw ka sah cih. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tukhyhze nang nynh muisaw kyalya te the na hoysah ze, a um buapaw ccungccaw huataw nynh lungtuabya na hopaw kha a thaethya khyh ze pawtemou “Amen” a cithya cih? <verse number="17" style="v" />Pawccecize nang nynh tuh ahoyte lungtuabya na ho ccaccing, thuasalama mingccangpaw tuh thawzung tynsah thuabua khyh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Nanning balyn laeze kae tuh thae leipaw bya ka ho keiccuze ka Pachia kha kou ka luung. <verse number="19" style="v" />Thuasalama khriccaawbuu kya thae leipaw bya te bya thong haw ka ho laeze, mingccang hae kha ccangpya khylan ka thinlung te bya kaw pangaw ho kha ka ryhua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Uteno hae, nae tuanaw kya imua hae thua nan oh; ahoy leipaw kya tuh nosi hae thua oh, thuasalama tuanaw kya tuh piccan hae thua oh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Kawbya kyaze:</para>
  <para style="q1">“Bawipaw nynh,</para>
  <para style="q2">‘Ccangpaw bya te thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ramccang hae munglae te thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">hynh-e ccungccaw hae kya</para>
  <para style="q1">bya ka ho cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuhzemah minmin nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">ka bya hynh ngaelae lan khyh hae,’ a ci,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite azeikuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:11-12">Isa 28.11-12</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v" />Tukeiccuze thae leipaw bya tuh a zyn hae paw hanlan thua leite, a zyn lei hae paw hanlan muihsahnaw nynh thua; thuasalama profehbya a hopaw tuh a zyn lei hae paw hanlan thua leite, a zyn hae paw hanlan nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tukeiccuze khriccaawbuu balyn nynh san kheit kya na thuakheih oh zah nae balynte thae leipaw bya na ho oh ze, atolang e ccungccaw hae, tuhkhyhze a zyn lei hae paw nynh oun teebua hae ze, nanning kha a ngaee vae hae ae ci lan khyh oh tou?</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thuasalama nae balynte profehbya na ho oh ze, a zyn leipaw, atolang e lu kheit nynh yn teebua ze, nae balynte a seinaw na muihsakuh oh zah aning kha na zynsah bua oh.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A zyn leipaw nynh a lungkaw te a tuakupaw balyn kha alangkuh vae cih; te aning nynh Pachia malang bakhungte a beik cih zah, “Pachia tuh nae kya a um ccaccing,” cite a ho vae cih.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pachia Beiknaw kya Zui lanpaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Uteno hae, tuhteze pawte cyi lan? Na pumku vae oh ze, nanning lu raveih nynh Sam hlawsahnaw, ccangpyanaw, byaphy honaw, thae leipaw byahonaw, asuilan leihthyanaw kha na cyi kalang oh. Pawpaw balyn tuh thawzung tynsah nawlan cyi thua sah. <verse number="27" style="v" />Lukhakheit nynh thae leipaw bya a ho ze, lu ning khyhze alunghua lu thum um hae sah lah, lu kheit koute lu kheit ho hae sah; te lu kheit nynh asuilan leih sah. <verse number="28" style="v" />Thuasalama asuilan a leihtu a um khyh lanze tuh-e paw tuh khriccaawbuu kya daebabi lan um sah lah, amaw te Pachia kalan kyalya ho sah. <verse number="29" style="v" />Profeh hae lu ning khyhze lu thum nynh ho hae sah lah, mingccang hae nynh hoyte tuase hae sah. <verse number="30" style="v" />A pe dahungpaw lukhakheit nynh Pachia kyate byaphy lanpaw a mue ze, masaty a hopaw ccungccaw kha daebabi lan um hin sah. <verse number="31" style="v" />Pawccecize nae balynte na ccangku nawlan oh te nae balynte thawzung pya na thua nawlan oh, nanning balyn nynh lu kheit koute lu kheit profehbya na ho kho oh. <verse number="32" style="v" />Profeh hae kya-e muisaw hae nynh profeh hae kaw a ngae hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia tuh keisukeilaepaw a umsahpaw thua leite daenaw a umsahpaw Pachia nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">(Mithyaa hae kya-e khriccaawbuu balyn kya a um hae hawte, <verse number="34" style="v" />nae nopi hae tuh khriccaawbuu hae kya daetedae lan um hae sah. Pawccecize minmin tuh byaho lan kaw-ua thua khyh hae, Kawbya nynh mah a ho hawte zakaw a sangsakuh cih hae. <verse number="35" style="v" />Minmin nynh ccangkhakheit a ny ry hae ze, innvaw kya mih vawpaw hae kha khiakuh hae sah. Pawccecize nopi nynh khriccaawbuu kya byaho lanpaw tuh maethya lan a um. <verse number="36" style="v" />Pachia bya hynh nanning kyate tou yn tho? Tuhkhyhze nae kalan kyalya tou yn thua?)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Lukhakheit nynh amaw te amaw kha profeh lu kheit nynh ka thua, tuhkhyhze muisaw thungnaw a hoipaw nynh ka thua cite a tuaku ze, nae kalan ka zeipaw hynh Bawipaw kawbya nynh thua cipaw la nyh sah. <verse number="38" style="v" />E hynh pawlang a ria leipaw tuh amaw kha mah pawlangria thua lan khyh. <verse number="39" style="v" />Tukeiccuze uteno hae, profehbya ho lanpaw hynh myarya ry oh lah, thae leipaw byaho kha la khee nan oh. <verse number="40" style="v" />Pawpaw balyn tuh kou ngaekuh lante, ccynmamyh lante cyi lanpaw nynh thua.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jesu Thoothuipaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Uteno hae, phe kae hopya vae oh paw thehoypaw kha atu kya nysah thui kae ry oh; tuh-e thehoypaw tuh na lawkuh oh zah tuh-e kya na thadyn oh; <verse number="2" style="v" />kae hopya oh paw bya kha nanning nynh accakaepaw kya zyn leite, varyng na kyngku oh ze, tuh-e thehoypaw liate khum na thua oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize ka muepaw abyapi huapaw kha nae kalan kae hopya pathy oh, tuh-e tuh: Ccathyaa kya azeiku thyhte Khri tuh aening seinaw hanlan a chih,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:5-12">Isa 53.5-12</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />aning tuh uh hae zah Ccathyaa kya azeiku thyhte nin thumnaw kya thoothuisah athua,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:8-10">Sam 16.8-10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:40">Mat 12.40</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:24-32">Loc 2.24-32</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />te Peter kya a langkuh koute a zuitu hae lu haw lae ning kya a langkuh cipaw kha nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:16-17">Mat 28.16-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14">Mar 16.14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:34">Luk 24.34</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 24:36">36</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19">Joh 20.19</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukoute uno hae za pangaw lae kyakhe ccyh kheit kya a langkuh. Tuh-e hae kyaze alunghua tuh a hiin ung hae, abang tuh a chih vae hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukoute James kya a langkuh, tukoute locceihtu hae balyn kya a langkuh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Nyathyakou, ninsaw ccing leite a puipaw hawte athuapaw kamaw kya mah a langkuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:3-6">Loc 9.3-6</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawccecize kae tuh Pachia khriccaawbuu kha a tuaa a sahpaw ka thua keiccuze locceihtu cite ko lan angaekuh bua leipaw, locceihtu hae lakuze anyaa huapaw nynh ka thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Loc 8.3</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuasalama Pachia thawccinaw liate kae tuh atu hawte ka thua kho zah, kae yn pyapaw a thawccinaw tuh alakawpaw lang tang khyh. ccangpaw locceihtu hae laeze ryalaw ka lahhua, tuhzemah kamaw ka lah khyh, ka kya a umpaw Pachia thawccinaw nynh thawte rya a lah. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze kae thuasah, minmin thuasah tuhte phung kae ho zah nanning nynh na zyn oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">A Chih hae paw Thoothuinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Atu lya Khri tuh chinaw kyate a thoothui cite ho athua ze, nanning lakuze abang nynh a chih hae paw tuh thoothuinaw um khyh cite pawtemou na ho kho oh? <verse number="13" style="v" />A chih hae paw tuh thoothuinaw a um khyh lanze, Khri tuh thoothui khyh cinawpaw nynh thua; <verse number="14" style="v" />Khri tuh a thoothui khyh lanze, kaening nynh phung kae hopaw tuh accakaepaw thua zah, nanning zynnaw mah accakaepaw nynh thua vae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Kaening tuh Pachia kya-e ahme leipaw ccaekia hae lang nynh oun muih vae hae; pawccecize Pachia nynh Khri kha a thoosah vae cite kaening nynh Pachia kong ccaekia kae khan; a chih hae paw thoothui khyh hae cipaw tuh ahme lanze, Pachia nynh Khri kha thoosah khyh cinawpaw nynh thua. <verse number="16" style="v" />Pawccecize a chih hae paw tuh a thoothui khyh hae ze, Khri tuh thoothui khyh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Khri tuh a thoothui khyh ze, nae zynnaw tuh accakaepaw thua zah, nanning tuh nae seinaw kya nynh na um ung oh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Khri kya a ih vae hae paw mah arohhang vae hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Aening nynh Khri kya ngaehoinaw ah hoi oh paw hynh hynh-e hiinnaw hanlan kyalya athua lanze, aening tuh ccungccaw hae balyn kyaze ngaethyaum huacce hae paw nynh ah thua cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thuasalama Khri tuh chinaw kyate thoothui zah a chih vae hae paw kyaze masaty athae lang a tang vae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Pawccecize ccungccaw lu kheit liate chinaw tuh yn thua hawte, a chih hae paw thoothuinaw mah ccungccaw lu kheit liate nynh yn thua. <verse number="22" style="v" />Adam keiccu ccungccaw balyn a chi hae hawte, Khri liate ccungccaw balyn hiinsah athua cih hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Thuasalama ccungccaw miakaw mawmaw ccyh kya thoosahthui athua cih hae; Khri tuh masaty athae nynh thua, tukoute Khri he yn thua te, Khri a ccungccaw hae tuh a thoothui cih hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Tukoute laephi she athangnaw ccyh yn thua cih; Khri nynh uktu miakaw, kawhoitu hae te huhan hoitu miakaw kha a roh kou hae te, peenaw kha Paaw Pachia kalan a ap cih. <verse number="25" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia nynh rhaw hae balyn kha a ccuphe kaw a nung kou hae cia, Khri nynh a uk cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sam 110.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="26" style="v" />Ro athua cih paw nyathyakou rhaw tuh chinaw nynh thua. <verse number="27" style="v" />Pawccecize Ccathyaa kyaze, “Pachia nynh pawpaw balyn kha Khri ccuphe kaw a nung vae,” cite a um. Thuasalama, “Pawpaw balyn kha amaw zakaw a nung,” cite a hopaw kya, pawpaw balyn amaw zakaw a nungtupaw Pachia tuh pabua khyh cipaw alang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:6">Sam 8.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="28" style="v" />Pawpaw balyn tuh Khri zakaw kya nung he athua te, pawpaw balyn kha amaw zakaw a nungtupaw Pachia tuh tynre balyn kya tynre athua nawlan, Ccapaw amaw mah Paaw zakaw kya nung athuabua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuhkhyh lanze, a chih hae paw ccelang baptisma a in hae paw tuh pawte cyih vae cih hae? A chih hae paw tuh a thoothui khyh hae ze, pawccemou minmin nynh a chih hae paw ccelang baptisma a in hae?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pawccemou aening so accyh takyhte rinaw kya palei ah um oh? <verse number="31" style="v" />Uteno hae, kae tuh nin takyhte ka chih! Nanning hanlan ah Bawipaw Khri Jesu kya ka pookunaw liate kae nynh hynhte ka honawpaw athua. <verse number="32" style="v" />Ccungccaw cyisahnaw lante Efesa khua kyakhe sarepaw hae ryte kae douku zeso, ka hanlan pawmou athane cih? A chih hae paw tuh a thoothui khyh hae ze, byaphung kya a um hawte,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Ae oh sih lah neih oh sih,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize awkhualan ah chih cih oh.” <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:13">Isa 22.13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />La lingsakuh nan oh:</para>
  <para style="q1">“Ahoy leipaw ryte mungkupaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ahoypaw ziazae kha a rosah.”</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nae lungkyhsakuh ccavae oh lah, sei nan vae oh; pawccecize abang ccungccaw tuh Pachia na nyh khyh oh. E hynh nae maethya ccaw cite nynh ka ho.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pyn Thoothuinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Thuasalama lukhakheit nynh, “A chih hae paw tuh pawtemou a thoothui cih hae? Pawcihawpaw pyn te mou oun langkuh cih hae?” cite a khia cih. <verse number="36" style="v" />Mingaeepaw! Na tupaw ccacii tuh a chi khyh ze, hiin lan khyh. <verse number="37" style="v" />Ccacii na tu vae ze, yn um lanpaw a pyn kha na tu khyh; chanvuih thuasah, ccangpaw ccacii thuasah ccacii maw kha nynh na tu. <verse number="38" style="v" />Thuasalama Pachia nynh a ry hawte pyn kha a pya, ccacii miakaw kha amaw aphuin thyhte pyn kha a pya. <verse number="39" style="v" />Ngesaw balyn tuh alokuhpaw ngesaw cci thua khyh; ccungccaw ngesaw tuh phuin kheit, sarangpaw hae ngesaw tuh phuin ccangpaw, ngasaw hae ngesaw tuh phuin ccangpaw, te pavaw hae ngesaw tuh phuin ccangpaw nynh thua. <verse number="40" style="v" />Vaawlang te asekuhpaw pyn hae um zah laephi te asekuhpaw pyn hae mah a um; thuasalama vaawlang te asekuhpaw phu-enaw tuh phuin kheit thua zah laephi te asekuhpaw phu-enaw tuh phuin ccangpaw nynh thua. <verse number="41" style="v" />Khuanin phu-enaw tuh phuin kheit, sawpaw phu-enaw tuh ccangpaw thua zah, awsi hae phu-enaw mah ccangpaw nynh thua; pawccecize awsi ccangkheit te ccangkheit mih phu-enaw tuh alae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuh-e hawte nynh a chih hae paw thoothuinaw mah athua. Uu athuapaw pyn tuh rohthya zah a thoothuipaw pyn tuh rohthya vae khyh. <verse number="43" style="v" />Uu athua lya tuh a thethah zah, he a thoothui tuh sawtuanaw a ccou. Uu athua lya tuh nyaa zah, he a thoothui tuh thungnaw te a beih. <verse number="44" style="v" />Puikhaepaw pyn tuh uu athua, muisaw pyn tuh thosathui athua; puikhaepaw pyn um zah muisaw pyn a um. <verse number="45" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Ccathyaa kyaze, “Masaty ccungccaw Adam tuh ahiinpaw ccungccaw lang yn tang,” cite azeikuh; nyathyakou Adam tuh hiinnaw a pyapaw muisaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Gen 2.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuhzemah muisaw pyn hynh masaty thua khyh, puikhaepaw pyn nynh a umty, tukoute nynh muisaw pyn tuh a um. <verse number="47" style="v" />Masaty ccungccaw tuh laephi kyate thua zah laenoi te raepaw nynh thua; lu ningnaw ccungccaw tuh vaawlang te yn thuapaw nynh thua. <verse number="48" style="v" />Laenoi ccungccaw hae tuh laenoi te raepaw ccungccapaw hawte nynh thua hae; vaawlang e ccungccaw hae mah vaawlang te yn thuapaw ccungccapaw hawte nynh thua hae. <verse number="49" style="v" />Aening tuh laenoi te raepaw ccungccapaw muinsan ah ke oh hawte, vaawlang te yn thuapaw ccungccapaw muinsan mah ah ke cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Uteno hae, e hynh kae hopya oh: chii te saw nynh tuh Pachia peenaw kha ccou kho lan khyh; aroh khopaw nynh aroh kho leipaw kha ccou kho lan khyh. <verse number="51" style="v" />Ngaetua oh, byakhupaw ccangkheit kae hopah oh! Aening ah balynte marya chi lei lan, thuasalama aening balyn tuh <verse number="52" style="v" />nyathyakou mungkae yn ccae te, sosohtari kya, mitsiphalah kya marya rulae ah thua cih oh. Pawccecize mungkae roi yn ccae cih zah a chih hae paw kha aroh kho leipaw lante thosathui athua cih hae zah aening tuh rulae ah thua cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.51-52: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:15-17">1Th 4.15-17</ref></char></note> <verse number="53" style="v" />Pawccecize hynh-e aroh khopaw pyn nynh aroh kho leipaw khate a ccaanku hahe ho zah, hynh-e a chih khopaw pyn nynh a chih kho leipaw khate a ccaanku hahe aho. <verse number="54" style="v" />Tukeiccuze hynh-e aroh khopaw nynh aroh kho leipaw khate ccaankuh zah hynh-e a chih khopaw nynh a chih kho leipaw khate he a ccaankuh te,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Chinaw tuh taenaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">po a laang vae,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite azeikuhpaw Ccathyaa tuh accing vae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />“Pou chinaw, na taenaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">teimou a um?</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou chinaw, na zunghe tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">teimou a um?”</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Chinaw a zunghe tuh seinaw thua zah, seinaw a thungnaw tuh kawbya nynh thua. <verse number="57" style="v" />Thuasalama ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri liate aening taenaw oun pyatupaw Pachia kya thehoynaw um sah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka sungsahpaw uteno hae, Bawipaw kya nae ryalaw tuh alakawpaw thua khyh cipaw na ny oh keiccuze tynkaring lan, nue kho um lei lante um oh lah, Bawipaw rya kha zungzae lah oh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Mithyaa hae hanlan Ahlu Khoipyapaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Atu mithyaa hae hanlan ahlu khoipyapaw kong lante, Galatia ram e khriccaawbuu hae kya kaw ka pya hae hawte nanning mah la cyihbua oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:25-26">Rom 15.25-26</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />He kae thua te, ahlu khoi aho vae khyh ccaw, lonaw takyh kyaze masaty nin khe nanning milu raveih nynh na mue oh paw thyhte ccangte la nung oh lah la ccy oh. <verse number="3" style="v" />He kae thua te, ka ccaw te nae lasung kha Jerusalem lang cciakhae khylan nae nawccawpaw ccungccaw hae kha ka saw cih hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Kamaw ccia lan accan ze, minmin tuh ka kya a cceihbua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Khuaccong lan Paccynkunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Atu Mesidonia ram kya po ka cceih koute nae kalan kae thua cih, pawccecize Mesidonia ram kya po ccia lan ka paccynkuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:21">Loc 19.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Teitei lang ka ccia zemah, khua ka ccongnaw kya nae cciakhae ccaw oh, athua kho ze nae kya sosoh ka umbua kho, khuaccihsaw heize nae kya po ka um kho. <verse number="7" style="v" />Pawccecize nae kalan cciapawte hung muihku kyalya te ka ry khyh; Bawipaw nynh yn ua ze, nanning ryte khaw umkheih lan ka ngaehoi. <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama Efesa khua kya Pentekos poi nin cia kae um ung cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Lev 23.15-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:9-11">Deu 16.9-11</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.8-9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:8-10">Loc 19.8-10</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawccecize athanepaw ryalaw elang akopaw thuakaw kha ka hanlan hungpya athua, rawsetu hae mah patae a um hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nae kalan Timote yn thua ze, ri leite nae kya a umbua nawlan pe la ki oh; pawccecize aning tuh kamaw hawte Bawipaw rya a lahpaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:17">1Ko 4.17</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze hum nynh sanmah amaw kha dothatheih nan sah. Aning nynh ka kalan yn thua nawlan, khua a ccongnaw kya daebabi lan yn saw oh; pawccecize aning yn thua lanpaw kha kae te uno hae nynh phang kae ngaw.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kae unopaw Apollos konglang tuh, uno hae ryte nae kalan yn cciabua nawlan thawte ka hopah zahmah, atu lya tuh kharouh cceihbua ry khyh; tuhzemah accyh yn ccanthya te yn cceih cih.</para>
  <para style="s1">Nyathya Hyynaw Bya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Raeringkute lungkyhrarih lan um oh, zynnaw kya tynkaring lan thadyn oh, nae rawthung sah, nae thawsae sah. <verse number="14" style="v" />Nanning nynh pawpaw balyn kha sungsakunaw te cyih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Uteno hae, Stefanas a innbyn hae tuh Akhai ram kyaze masaty Khriccaaw hae thua hae zah, minmin tuh mithyaa hae ryalaw khylan mimaw te mimaw a pyakuh hae cipaw na ny oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:16">1Ko 1.16</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />Khahcihawpaw ccungccaw hae te minmin ryte thawte rya a lahkheih hae paw miakaw kalan naemaw te naemaw kha na pyaku nawlan oh thawte kae ngia oh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Stefanas, Fortunatas te Akhaikus oun thua hae paw kong ka lungtua; pawccecize nanning na um khyh lya oh kae kha yn bawm hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Pawccecize minmin nynh nae thaw ae muinsah oh hawte ka thaw yn muinsah bua hae. Tukeiccuze khahcihawpaw ccungccaw hae kha la luung oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Asia ram e khriccaawbuu hae nynh nanning kha ae beihlang oh. Akuila te Prisilla nynh mih inn kya apumkuhpaw khriccaawbuu ryte nanning kha Bawipaw kya thinlung ccaccingte ae beihlang oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:2">Loc 18.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" />Uteno hae balyn nynh nanning kha ae beihlang oh. Lu kheit te lu kheit athyaapaw myngkunaw te byabeihkuh oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kae, Paul nynh hynh-e beihlangnaw bya hynh kamaw ka kuih te nynh ka zei. <verse number="22" style="v" />Humhung zemah Bawipaw a sungsah leipaw tuh thyalaw thua sah. Kae Bawipaw, yn thua ccavae! <verse number="23" style="v" />Bawipaw Jesu thawccinaw tuh nae kya la um sah. <verse number="24" style="v" />Khri Jesu kya kae sungsahnaw oh paw tuh nae balyn tungvaw kya la um vae sah. Amen.</para>
</usx>